oubleshooting.mdx","Resolución de problemas de despliegue","Diagnostica acceso, salud de los servicios y dependencias de infraestructura.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/deployment/troubleshooting",{"_81":428},"deployment/troubleshooting.mdx",{"_56":430,"_63":102,"_77":-7,"_58":431},"es:_9","Otros modelos",{"_56":433,"_63":74,"_58":434,"_68":435,"_77":-7,"_13":436,"_79":437},"es:deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx","Despliega desde AWS Marketplace","Ejecuta una instancia preconfigurada de Lamassu IoT en Amazon EC2.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/deployment/aws-marketplace",{"_81":438},"deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx",{"_56":440,"_63":74,"_58":441,"_68":442,"_77":-7,"_13":443,"_79":444},"es:deployment/saas.mdx","Utiliza Lamassu como SaaS","Consume Lamassu como servicio gestionado sin operar infraestructura propia.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/es/deployment/saas",{"_81":445},"deployment/saas.mdx","es:deployment",{"_214":448},"deployment/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/images/kubernetes.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-76/images/kubernetes.svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;vertical-align:middle;flex-shrink:0;object-fit:contain\"/>",{"_63":64,"_58":451,"_65":66,"_67":-7,"_68":452,"_70":-7,"_60":453,"_56":459,"_79":460,"_77":462},"Actualizaciones","Guía de versión a versión para el operador",[454],{"_56":455,"_63":74,"_58":48,"_68":456,"_77":-7,"_13":47,"_79":457},"es:upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","Qué cambia en la arquitectura de 4.0.0, qué cambios rompen un despliegue 3.8.0, cómo actualizar paso a paso una release de Helm y cómo validar el resultado.",{"_81":458},"upgrades/3-8-0-to-4-0-0.mdx","es:upgrades",{"_214":461},"upgrades/meta.json","<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-arrow-up shrink-0 text-[#c8861f]\" ar